        "line_width_desktop": 290,
        "line_width_mobile": 260,
        "left_content": "<ul><li>World’s first refillable fluoride removal cartridge uses advanced technology to remove more than 95% of fluoride, without using reverse osmosis.</li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the most effective and sustainable Fluoride removal on the market.</li><li>Less waste and plastic than other fluoride removal cartridges - no electricity required.</li></ul>",
