        "right_content": "<ul><li>Housed in 304 stainless steel, the most chemically-neutral and safe material for domestic water filtration, perfectly compatible with all Gravity Systems and easy to set up.</li><li>The POSTreat is designed for maximum re-use, with our replaceable proprietary <a href=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/products/postreat-fluorid-media-refill\" title=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/products/postreat-fluorid-media-refill\">FluoRid Filtration media-</a> refillable every 4 months.</li></ul>",
